The CSV delimiter comes from [[args.delimiter]], which the global
[[-d]]/[[--delimiter]] option supplies; this subcommand adds no delimiter
option of its own.
It used to add a [[--delimiter]]/[[-D]] with a tab default, and that
duplicate was worse than redundant: it reset [[args.delimiter]] for every
invocation, so [[canvaslms -d , calendar list]] kept emitting tabs
(\cref{sec:global-options-are-global}).

